ame": "Mario Nawfal", "username": "MarioNawfal"}, "content": "\ud83c\uddea\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf7\ud83c\uddfa Ursula von der Leyen says RUSSIA IS USING MASS MIGRATION as a weapon against EUROPE\n\nThe EU chief accuses Russia of deliberately pushing migrants toward European borders to overwhelm authorities, spread fear and divide the continent.\n\nShe now wants new emergency powers to", "parentTweet": false, "likes": 11605}}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToPXxAf9", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 43, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8901407, "raw_content": "", "author": "stormdraintrooper", "created": 1792754544611, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "hatredcopter", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToPXxAf9.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/JyBwjwIcgXIk.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/facD2rlulexbOBVK.jpeg", "width": 533, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "U7C6lg?H01IT00R*wbIW~VV@x]%LInRiofj^", "full_resolution": [2411, 1673]}, "title": "eMudhra Trust Delivered    This whole thing is lol", "last_comment_created": 1792759336447, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 6, "score_up": 43, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1AToPXxArY", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 38, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8901438, "raw_content": "I've noticed more comments here declaring our entire federal government illegitimate. Not specific officials. Not particular unconstitutional acts. The entire government.\r\n\r\nThat concerns me because governmental illegitimacy is precisely the message being promoted by the networks DataRepublican has been exposing. Now I'm seeing people repeat it on PDW as though it's an expression of loyalty to America.\r\n\r\nWhen someone says the federal government has been illegitimate \u201cat least since January 20, 2021,\u201d that declaration includes Trump's current administration. Think about what you're endorsing before applauding it.\r\n\r\nI'm not claiming everyone repeating this is a DSA member or acting under instructions. People can spread propaganda without knowing whose objectives it serves. That's why the message deserves examination regardless of who's posting it.\r\n\r\nExpose corruption. Challenge unconstitutional conduct. Hold officials accountable. But explain the leap from those grievances to declaring our entire government illegitimate. Anger isn't proof, and repetition doesn't supply the missing argument.", "author": "Agent_86", "created": 1792756833265, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Agent_86", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Is it just me, or are more posters here declaring our entire federal government illegitimate?", "last_comment_created": 1792772603810, "content": "<p>I've noticed more comments here declaring our entire federal government illegitimate. Not specific officials. Not particular unconstitutional acts. The entire government.</p>\n<p>That concerns me because governmental illegitimacy is precisely the message being promoted by the networks DataRepublican has been exposing. Now I'm seeing people repeat it on PDW as though it's an expression of loyalty to America.</p>\n<p>When someone says the federal government has been illegitimate \u201cat least since January 20, 2021,\u201d that declaration includes Trump's current administration. Think about what you're endorsing before applauding it.</p>\n<p>I'm not claiming everyone repeating this is a DSA member or acting under instructions. People can spread propaganda without knowing whose objectives it serves. That's why the message deserves examination regardless of who's posting it.</p>\n<p>Expose corruption. Challenge unconstitutional conduct. Hold officials accountable. But explain the leap from those grievances to declaring our entire government illegitimate. Anger isn't proof, and repetition doesn't supply the missing argument.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 40, "score_up": 38, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2113599253306081526", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToPXxRmH", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 31, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "hunter", "id": 8901515, "raw_content": "", "author": "journalist", "created": 1792760772052, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "Lol_Garrus", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1AToPXxRmH.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/jamesnoble57257/status/2113599253306081526?s=20", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false,